# scoring — score increment/decrement, max score, player description, status line

max score: 10
player "You look sharp and ready for adventure."
status score, moves

verb collect
    takes noun
    "Nothing to collect."

verb spend
    takes noun
    "Nothing to spend."

room Hall "A grand entrance hall."

    object coin "A gold coin."

        instead of collect:
            score + 5
            say "You collect the coin."

        instead of spend:
            score - 2
            say "You spend the coin."

test "default"
    collect coin. "You collect the coin"
    spend coin. "You spend the coin"
    examine me. "You look sharp"
